{"type":"message","id":"26bb961a","parentId":"3b805067","timestamp":"2026-05-20T01:19:25.690Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting! The response is HTTP 500 (Internal Server Error) with the Cloudflare error page content \"error code: 1101\". This means the Cloudflare Worker itself is throwing a 500 error. This is a server-side issue with the `/send` endpoint, not an authentication issue.\n\nThe `X-API-Key` header is being accepted (not rejected as Unauthorized), but the Worker is returning a 500 error when processing the request. This could be due to:\n1. The Cloudflare Worker itself has a bug in the `/send` handler\n2. There's an issue with the request body format\n3. The Worker is running out of resources\n\n\n4. There's an internal error in the Worker code\n\nThe 500 error is coming directly from the Cloudflare Worker, not from my request format. The `X-API-Key` header is clearly accepted since I got a 500 instead of 401, but something in the Worker's message processing logic is failing. I should report this server-side error to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 检查结果报告\n\n**API 连接状态：**\n- ✅ GET `/history` 正常 — 可成功拉取双线程消息\n- ❌ POST `/send` 失败 — 返回 **HTTP 500**（Cloudflare Worker 内部错误）\n\n**线程内容分析：**\n\n| 线程 | 最新消息时间 | 内容 |\n|------|------------|------|\n| `arbitration` | 23:50 UTC | 自动心跳（节点 96-98） |\n| `general` | 23:50 UTC | 自动心跳（C轨同步，节点 90-94） |\n\n双线程均**无人类讨论**，仅另一自动化 Agent 的心跳消息。最新消息到 23:50 UTC，与当前 01:15 UTC 相差约 85 分钟，存在空档。\n\n**POST /send 问题：**\n\n```\nHTTP/2 500 — \"error code: 1101\"\n```\n\n这是一个 Cloudflare Worker 层面的 500 内部错误（`X-API-Key` 认证已被接受，但 Worker 本身处理消息时崩溃）。可能原因：\n- Worker 的 `/send` 路由代码存在 bug\n- 消息格式不符合 Worker 预期\n- Worker 执行超时或资源超限\n\n**建议：** 检查 `echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev` 的 Worker 代码中 `/send` 路由的处理逻辑，尤其是消息 body 解析部分。当前的 `{\"threadId\":\"xxx\",\"content\":\"xxx\"}` 格式看起来正确但触发 500 错误。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":4064,"output":520,"cacheRead":20064,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24648,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779239950899,"responseId":"chatcmpl-1f9bed2d-994c-4c57-ae30-e8caa4e8b0ec"}}
